    <string name="title_activity_interstitial_ad_mob">MainActivity</string>
    <string name="info_1">Make the lines that made you — turn iconic anime quotes into shareable cards. Offline. Free. Built for fans who post what they feel.</string>
    <string name="info_2">Quotes ship in the app for offline browsing. Card Studio templates, Daily Drop, and collections help you craft and keep the lines that define you.</string>
    <string name="info_3">Support development by watching a short ad (Cita button), or open the project on GitHub.</string>
    <string name="content_tip">Creator tip: export a Stories card in Cita, then post to Reels/TikTok with “Made in Cita.” See docs/CONTENT_ENGINE.md on GitHub.</string>
    <string name="text_4">You get a few free saves to start.\nWatch a rewarded ad for more ad-free saves, or a short ad to save once.</string>
